      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHE'S A JUMBO (1) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing seventh (26.40) in a Grade 4/5 at Murray Bridge. The form out of last race has been strong. Ready to return to form. BLACK AMETHYST (2) turned in a plain performance last time when fifth at Angle Park over 342m behind Osprey Chronos (20.15) in a Other. Was in the money the start prior. Form from her last run is proving strong. Should be about the money. JAZZY BOO (8) had a wide draw last time when running fourth (17.86) over 305m at Mt Gambier in a Other. Goes very well here at the trip finding the frame in each of five starts. Has ability and is one of the better chances. ASTON BAKER (4) looks a top-three chance while fresh.",
